!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = shRNA: uninduced shPSMD2
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = agent: DMSO
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Cells treated with DMSO or 20nM Bortezomib for 16 hours
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = T47D cells were grown to 70% confluency the shPSMD2 was induced with 0.2ug/ml of doxycycline for 3 days . Cells were then spit into media lacking Dox and after 24 hours treated with with either DMSO or 20nM Bortezomib. Samples were collecte dafter 16 hours for RNA extraction.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = cells were collected and extracted using Trizol reagent.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNAseq libraries were prepared using the TruSeq stranded polyA mRNA kits as described by the manufacturer (Illumina RS-122-2101).
!Sample_data_processing = RNASeq reads were aligned using STAR (v2.5.4b) using default parameters (except --sjdbOverhang 39 ) to the human genome (GRCh37) with Ensembl annotation (GRCh37.87) in gtf format.
!Sample_data_processing = featureCounts (v1.6.1) was used with default parameters except for -s 2 (reversely stranded)
